# Supabase

Postgres and file storage are Supabase. Do not add another database or S3-compatible store.

- Sequelize uses `DATABASE_URL` with SSL. Session pooler (5432) or direct connection only.
- Storage uploads use `supabaseAdmin` on the API. Web may use the anon client for public URLs.
- Daily work reports stay in Postgres text columns, never in Storage.
- Never commit or expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` to `apps/web`.
